<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the real one.</font>

49
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:45,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

50
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as it goes.</font>

51
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said it was pointless.</font>

52
00:03:57,250 --> 00:03:59,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't let him beat you Naruto-kun.</font>

53
00:04:04,550 --> 00:04:09,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been telling you not
