<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

55
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be.</font>

56
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:21,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Go Naruto!</font>

57
00:04:23,150 --> 00:04:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...!</font>

58
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:29,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He foiled my idea and purposely
and drew one of his clones back?</font>

59
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been striking from the beginning
prepared for an honorable death!</font>

60
00:04:37,170 --> 00:04:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it.</font>

61
