<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What was that?</font>

63
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you think you'd won?</font>

64
00:05:07,570 --> 00:05:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

65
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:11,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto's punch should've hit.</font>

66
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:13,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That...</font>

67
00:05:17,710 --> 00:05:19,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rotation...</font>

68
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's Neji's defense.</font>

69
00:05:27,130 --> 00:05:29,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punk.
Don't make a fool of me.</font>

70
00:05:34,230 --> 00:05:38,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The largest range of vision of
Neji's Byakugan is nearly 360 degrees.</font>

71
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:43,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he detects all of his opponent's
attacks with the Byakugan.</font>

72
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His defense technique
the 8 Trigrams Palms Rotation</font>

73
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will begin from here.</font>

74
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:12,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The moment he's attacked
he discharges a large amount of Chakra</font>

75
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:16,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from the Chakra holes in the body
blocks the enemy's attack with that Chakra</font>

76
00:06:16,770 --> 00:06:21,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">moves his own body in a circular motion
dodges and repels.</font>

77
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Essentially it's difficult to control
the Chakra discharged from Chakra holes...</font>

78
00:06:27,150 --> 00:06:30,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To the extent that even Jonin utilize
the discharge from a part of the body</font>

79
00:06:30,570 --> 00:06:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like the hands and feet
in techniques.</font>

80
00:06:33,530 --> 00:06:37,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Neji who has mastered
Gentle Fist discharges Chakra</font>

81
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:40,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from his entire body and
shuts out physical attacks</font>

82
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just with that discharge power.</font>

83
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:44,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words</font>

84
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:47,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's one more absolute defense</font>

85
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that has more power
than that Gaara's Sand Shield.</font>

86
00:06:57,140 --> 00:06:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's father's...</font>

87
00:06:59,230 --> 00:07:02,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Rotation is a secret Art passed down
from generation to generation</font>

88
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:05,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only to the Hyuga head family
in other words the Hyuga clan.</font>

89
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He created that on his own...?</font>

90
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's quite the guy...
To think he'd come this far.</font>

91
00:07:14,490 --> 00:07:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's much too soon to be surprised.
Neji's true power is still to come.</font>

92
00:07:20,750 --> 00:07:22,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it.</font>

93
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the end.</font>

94
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:29,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're within the area of my 8 Trigrams.</font>

95
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:42,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gentle Fist Art.</font>

96
00:07:43,350 --> 00:07:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Trigrams 64 Palms.</font>

97
00:07:45,860 --> 00:07:46,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be.</font>

98
00:07:47,190 --> 00:07:48,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That pose.</font>

99
00:07:57,030 --> 00:07:58,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Tetragrams...</font>

100
00:07:59,250 --> 00:08:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...2 Palms!</font>

101
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">4 Palms.</font>

102
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">8 Palms.</font>

103
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:09,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">16 Palms.</font>

104
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">32 Palms.</font>

105
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">64 Palms!</font>

106
00:08:21,890 --> 00:08:24,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The branch family exceeds
the head family?</font>

107
00:08:38,660 --> 00:08:40,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

108
00:08:46,130 --> 00:08:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Truly a terrifying talent.</font>

109
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think the power of the
Hyuga Kekkei Genkai</font>

110
00:08:51,630 --> 00:08:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be passed on so strongly
to a child of the branch family</font>

111
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who would never be able
to be an heir.</font>

112
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hizashi... You should have
succeeded the Hyuga family.</font>

113
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:08,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I pressed the 64 Chakra Points
all over your body...</font>

114
00:09:08,610 --> 00:09:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't even stand.</font>

115
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it.</font>

116
00:09:16,780 --> 00:09:18,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you frustrated?</font>

117
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kneeling down before power
that can't be changed</font>

118
00:09:21,330 --> 00:09:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and knowing your powerlessness.</font>

119
00:09:24,210 --> 00:09:27,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your dreams will come true
if you just work hard.</font>

120
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just an illusion.</font>

121
00:09:31,420 --> 00:09:33,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata. Are you okay?</font>

122
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh man. I knew it.</font>

123
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

124
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:09,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy brow...</font>

125
00:10:12,670 --> 00:10:13,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata.</font>

126
00:10:20,890 --> 00:10:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">D-Damn it.</font>

127
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

128
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

129
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He... No way.</font>

130
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I told you didn't I...?</font>

131
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:55,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know when to give up.</font>

132
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

133
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you're bleeding.</font>

134
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:13,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

135
00:11:14,860 --> 00:11:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've still got damage
from the match.</font>

136
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... Hang in there.</font>

137
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:28,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take a look at her.</font>

138
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:30,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who're you?</font>

139
00:11:31,750 --> 00:11:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not suspicious or anything.</font>

140
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop already...</font>

141
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be the same even if
you fight more than this.</font>

142
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have a grudge particularly
against you.</font>

143
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:43,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Shut up...</font>

144
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you say so
I have something against you.</font>

145
00:11:47,350 --> 00:11:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you talking about?</font>

146
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:53,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...? Here you're this strong...</font>

147
00:11:54,060 --> 00:11:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why did you with a look like
you've seen through it all</font>

148
00:11:57,610 --> 00:12:03,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">go after Hinata mentally
who was trying so hard?</font>

149
00:12:04,030 --> 00:12:06,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has nothing to do with you.</font>

150
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:11,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mocking Hinata selfishly labeling
her a failure as you please.</font>

151
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Head family branch family...</font>

152
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what happened to you.</font>

153
00:12:18,090 --> 00:12:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I won't forgive the jerk who'd
call another person a failure.</font>

154
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:30,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you.</font>

155
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay. I'm a doctor.</font>

156
00:12:34,690 --> 00:12:37,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay... Fine.</font>

157
00:12:37,230 --> 00:12:42,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you insist I'll tell you about
the Hyuga's destiny of hatred.</font>

158
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:46,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the Hyuga head family
there's a secret Ninjutsu</font>

159
00:12:46,870 --> 00:12:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's been passed on
from generation to generation.</font>

160
00:12:49,790 --> 00:12:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the Curse Mark Arts.</font>

161
00:12:52,710 --> 00:12:54,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curse Mark Arts?</font>

162
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:03,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark represents
a bird in a cage...</font>

163
00:13:05,010 --> 00:13:08,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and it's a mark of those who are
bound to a destiny they can't escape.</font>

164
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's...</font>

165
00:13:34,460 --> 00:13:36,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...t-that mark?</font>

166
00:13:37,460 --> 00:13:39,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One day when I was four years old</font>

167
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:44,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this accursed mark was inscribed
on my forehead with the Curse Mark Arts.</font>

168
00:13:47,010 --> 00:13:51,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A large ceremony was held in
the Village Hidden in Leaves on that day.</font>

169
00:13:51,930 --> 00:13:55,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was also the day when the
head Ninja of the Land of Lightning</font>

170
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:57,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the land that the Leaf had
fought with for many years</font>

171
00:13:57,390 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">came for the conclusion
of the allied treaty.</font>

172
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However there was one clan...</font>

173
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who didn't attend the ceremony
that was attended</font>

174
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:10,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by everybody else
from Leaf Jonin to Genin.</font>

175
00:14:11,780 --> 00:14:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the Hyuga clan...</font>

176
00:14:14,410 --> 00:14:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's because that day
was the day of hope</font>

177
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:19,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when the head family heir
was to turn three.</font>

178
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-sama's third birthday!</font>

179
00:14:37,430 --> 00:14:39,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father Hyuga Hizashi</font>

180
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:44,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Hinata-sama's father who's over there
Hyuga Hiashi-sama were twin brothers.</font>

181
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However Hinata-sama's father
Hiashi-sama</font>

182
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the eldest son of the head family
born into this world first.</font>

183
00:14:53,910 --> 00:14:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And my father who was the second son
is a member of the branch family.</font>

184
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Hinata-sama is already three...</font>

185
00:15:02,210 --> 00:15:03,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Congratulations.</font>

186
00:15:04,090 --> 00:15:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you.</font>

187
00:15:13,350 --> 00:15:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a cute girl isn't she father?</font>

188
00:15:21,310 --> 00:15:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, father?</font>

189
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:27,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's nothing.</font>

190
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then...</font>

191
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be taking Neji under my care Hizashi.</font>

192
00:15:33,490 --> 00:15:34,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

193
00:15:35,780 --> 00:15:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When the head family heir grew
and became three years old</font>

194
00:15:41,370 --> 00:15:45,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had the Curse Mark imprinted on me
and I became the bird in the cage.</font>

195
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And became the Hyuga branch family.</font>

196
00:15:47,460 --> 00:15:50,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's it necessary to do
something like that?</font>

197
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why separate into a head family
and a branch family?</font>

198
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does that weird mark mean?</font>

199
00:15:57,010 --> 00:16:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This mark on my forehead
isn't just a decoration.</font>

200
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pull of your legs is weak.</font>

201
00:16:11,950 --> 00:16:12,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

202
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen Neji.</font>

203
00:16:21,290 --> 00:16:25,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will live to protect Hinata-sama
of the head family</font>

204
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as well as the Hyuga power.</font>

205
00:16:29,210 --> 00:16:30,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, father.</font>

206
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:53,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Murderous Intent.</font>

207
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:03,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My head.</font>

208
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father.</font>

209
00:17:07,380 --> 00:17:08,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong father?</font>

210
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go home.
I'll forgive the fool today only.</font>

211
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not to forget your destiny.</font>

212
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:27,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Curse Mark is the absolute fear
called death so to speak...</font>

213
00:17:27,060 --> 00:17:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that was given to the branch family
by the head family.</font>

214
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Secret Sign that the
head family members form easily</font>

215
00:17:33,530 --> 00:17:36,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">destroys the cerebral nerves
of those in the branch family.</font>

216
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:40,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course killing is easy.</font>

217
00:17:41,030 --> 00:17:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And this mark only goes away
at time of death.</font>

218
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:48,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sealing away the power
of the Byakugan.</font>

219
00:17:53,170 --> 00:17:57,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hyuga family is the clan that possesses
the most distinctive Kekkei Genkai.</font>

220
00:17:58,010 --> 00:18:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no end to those who
target the secret of that distinctive power.</font>

221
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:07,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words this Curse Mark
keeps the branch family alive</font>

222
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">only to protect the head family
and does not allow disobedience.</font>

223
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's an effective system created
to defend for eternity</font>

224
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Kekkei Genkai called Byakugan.</font>

225
00:18:18,360 --> 00:18:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then that incident occurred.</font>

226
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My father was killed by
the head family.</font>

227
00:18:33,050 --> 00:18:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One night Hinata-sama was
snatched up by someone.</font>

228
00:19:02,990 --> 00:19:07,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time Hiashi-sama immediately
rushed off and killed the abductor.</font>

229
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:11,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who do you think that person was...</font>

230
00:19:11,120 --> 00:19:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who was in the shadows
and also wearing a mask?</font>

231
00:19:16,340 --> 00:19:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was the head Shinobi of
the Land of Lightning</font>

232
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:23,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who had just completed
