<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">made a deal with the Lightning.</font>

241
00:19:56,290 --> 00:19:57,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A deal?</font>

242
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:00,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Lightning demand was
the body of the Hyuga head family</font>

243
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:03,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who possesses Byakugan
the Kekkei Genkai...</font>

244
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words
the body of Hiashi-sama.</font>

245
00:20:10,730 --> 00:20:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the Leaf accepted the condition.</font>

246
00:20:14,150 --> 00:20:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? But father...</font>

247
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And war was safely avoided.</font>

248
00:20:21,610 --> 00:20:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to my father who was killed
as a body double of Hyuga Hiashi</font>

